WEBVTT

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.300
At this point,
there's no substitute for you.

00:02:31.733 --> 00:02:33.303
You won't get any thanks from me.

00:02:34.233 --> 00:02:35.273
That's fine.

00:02:49.566 --> 00:02:55.096
The one thing I must do right now...
is to see Zola one more time!

00:02:55.666 --> 00:03:00.626
THE TWO PLEDGES

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:13.103
Okay, let's go.

00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:19.633
Crushing Nail!

00:03:24.566 --> 00:03:25.766
Conquer!

00:03:47.866 --> 00:03:49.126
Geez...

00:03:49.266 --> 00:03:51.366
You guys are so precarious.

00:03:51.666 --> 00:03:55.826
It's pathetic to think that we used to
have trouble against these guys.

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:57.133
What?

00:03:57.166 --> 00:03:58.426
How annoying!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.030
You're such a handful.

00:04:07.066 --> 00:04:10.296
Exactly what you'd expect of leftovers
from General Logi's elite troops.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.400
What?!

00:04:11.433 --> 00:04:13.003
You're one to talk!

00:04:14.933 --> 00:04:17.973
Come on, let's all get along.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.830
It's not good to argue, maro.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.300
They're bickering,

00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:24.133
but they're still helping
each other out.

00:04:24.633 --> 00:04:25.973
Yeah but...

00:04:26.333 --> 00:04:29.103
I don't like this kind
of atmosphere, maro.

00:04:38.566 --> 00:04:40.026
So General Logi.

00:04:40.633 --> 00:04:43.233
How are we supposed to
know where Zola is?

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:44.830
How? How?

00:04:52.466 --> 00:04:56.066
There is only one place
where she will be awaiting.

00:05:00.166 --> 00:05:01.396
The Sealed Grounds!

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:09.900
As the result of deciphering the Book of
the Beginning and the Extra Seven,

00:05:09.933 --> 00:05:12.773
we've learned that
the Sealed Grounds were a system

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:15.300
that was created using
the ancient technology.

00:05:15.766 --> 00:05:17.696
It is said,
that even with that system,

00:05:17.733 --> 00:05:20.303
it took five days for
the Darkness to be sealed.

00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:24.866
It's likely that the same amount of time
is necessary to release the Darkness.

00:05:25.866 --> 00:05:28.696
In other words,
the Darkness needs

00:05:28.733 --> 00:05:33.233
the system until
its release is complete.

00:05:36.633 --> 00:05:38.803
Once the Darkness
is completely free,

00:05:38.833 --> 00:05:43.533
they will destroy the Sealed Grounds
so they can never be sealed again.

00:05:44.033 --> 00:05:47.233
Zola should be waiting there
for that moment.

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:49.270
What's wrong?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:50.670
Look at that.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.970
That's a huge gate!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.700
That wasn't there before...

00:06:02.366 --> 00:06:06.166
We have to go through this canyon
to reach the Sealed Grounds.

00:06:06.633 --> 00:06:09.733
In other words,
to arrive where Zola is.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.330
Alright, let's go!

00:06:22.133 --> 00:06:23.803
Ahh, wait!

00:06:23.833 --> 00:06:25.773
I'm coming too, maro!

00:06:31.966 --> 00:06:32.626
Stop!

00:06:54.466 --> 00:06:56.326
W-What are these?!

00:06:56.466 --> 00:06:58.366
They are different from
the ones before, maro!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.600
Shu, fall back!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.530
Everyone, summon your Shadows
and get ready for battle!

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:13.170
This pressure...

00:07:13.866 --> 00:07:15.726
General Logi, please step back!

00:07:29.166 --> 00:07:31.526
- Interesting...
- Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.200
Minotaur!

00:07:33.466 --> 00:07:34.126
Yeah!

00:07:34.233 --> 00:07:35.473
Leave it to me!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:36.500
Fools!

00:07:36.533 --> 00:07:37.533
Be careful!

00:07:37.566 --> 00:07:40.296
Their power is different from
what we've experienced so far!

00:07:40.566 --> 00:07:42.626
It doesn't matter! Take this!

00:07:43.166 --> 00:07:45.026
Blue Explosion!

00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:51.333
Conquer!

00:07:58.466 --> 00:07:59.466
They disappeared!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.070
No, that's not it!

00:08:14.566 --> 00:08:16.726
I'll save them, maro!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.970
Please be careful, Marumaro!

00:08:23.533 --> 00:08:25.303
Schneider! Support them!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:26.270
Yes, sir!

00:08:32.366 --> 00:08:33.366
What?!

00:08:34.333 --> 00:08:35.903
Marumaro! Behind you!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.130
Maro!

00:08:39.233 --> 00:08:41.073
Sigrdrifa!

00:08:48.466 --> 00:08:49.466
Thank you.

00:08:49.766 --> 00:08:51.666
Logi... Thanks, maro.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.930
With so many in the way,
it's hard to make a move.

00:08:55.266 --> 00:08:59.326
It's hard to read their moves
underground, too.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.470
So what should we do,
General Logi?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:09.570
Leave this up to
my men and me.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.500
You go through that gate
and continue on.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:13.870
Huh?

00:09:14.266 --> 00:09:18.696
That's a clever idea.
I don't plan to use up my power here.

00:09:19.233 --> 00:09:21.273
I don't plan to die either.

00:09:21.666 --> 00:09:25.526
After all, without all seven of us,
we won't be able to seal the Darkness.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:28.800
Don't push your way!
I will fight, too!

00:09:29.133 --> 00:09:31.273
Stay quiet and listen here.

00:09:31.666 --> 00:09:33.126
In order to defeat them,

00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.566
we need Andropov's tracking
abilities in the back,

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.800
and two people in front of him.

00:09:37.966 --> 00:09:39.426
So we need the total of three people.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.400
It's easier for us to do this
without you guys

00:09:42.433 --> 00:09:44.933
because the three of us are
so used to working together.

00:09:45.466 --> 00:09:46.496
That's right.

00:09:47.066 --> 00:09:47.726
Listen.

00:09:48.166 --> 00:09:49.526
It could just be a brief moment.

00:09:50.066 --> 00:09:52.296
Stop their moves.

00:09:53.033 --> 00:09:55.273
I will open the gate while
you keep them busy.

00:09:56.933 --> 00:10:01.233
And you guys run through
the gate and move forward.

00:10:01.533 --> 00:10:04.373
Even as we speak,
the Darkness is growing.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.670
What about you guys?

00:10:07.433 --> 00:10:09.773
We'll catch up after
we put these two to rest.

00:10:10.066 --> 00:10:13.766
No way!
I won't take an order like that!

00:10:15.933 --> 00:10:16.603
Kluke.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.630
Can you convince that idiot?

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:22.700
But, I can't leave you guys either...

00:10:23.066 --> 00:10:23.726
Please.

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:26.370
But...

00:10:27.866 --> 00:10:28.866
I promise.

00:10:29.433 --> 00:10:30.103
I will...

00:10:30.633 --> 00:10:33.533
No, we will never die.

00:10:34.866 --> 00:10:35.526
So please...

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.970
Okay... I'll do it.

00:10:41.566 --> 00:10:42.226
Thanks.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.100
Hey, you guys!

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:53.630
Shu, please.
Listen to them.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:54.670
Huh?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.370
But...

00:10:57.266 --> 00:10:57.926
Please!

00:11:03.933 --> 00:11:04.603
Let's go!

00:11:17.933 --> 00:11:19.633
Lightning Cage!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.070
Now! Go!

00:11:53.966 --> 00:11:54.626
Shu!

00:11:59.233 --> 00:12:00.473
What are you doing?!

00:12:00.966 --> 00:12:02.696
They're gonna start moving!

00:12:05.933 --> 00:12:06.973
Hurry! Go!

00:12:07.133 --> 00:12:07.803
Shu!

00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:13.303
Damn it!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:24.900
Schneider, Andropov! You go, too!

00:12:41.333 --> 00:12:42.333
Schneider?!

00:12:42.966 --> 00:12:46.396
General Logi, leave this up to us.

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.670
Schneider...

00:12:47.866 --> 00:12:48.866
What are you?!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:03.970
Now then...

00:13:04.433 --> 00:13:06.903
All we have to do is defeat them.

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.270
Schneider! Andropov!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:13.100
Don't act on your own!
Open the gate!

00:13:13.466 --> 00:13:15.396
General Logi, we can't do that.

00:13:16.266 --> 00:13:16.926
What?!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:23.600
You see, you are a Soldier of Light.
We can't take the risk.

00:13:23.733 --> 00:13:26.773
Our mission is to stay right here.

00:13:27.366 --> 00:13:29.966
General Logi, please hurry
on your way with them.

00:13:38.966 --> 00:13:39.966
Let's go.

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.530
You have great men.

00:13:46.833 --> 00:13:48.273
Seems like they finally went.

00:13:48.533 --> 00:13:50.703
General Logi is pretty stubborn.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.100
The tables have turned.

00:13:54.533 --> 00:13:58.073
If you want to go past us,
you must defeat us.

00:14:00.166 --> 00:14:01.826
Crystal Square!

00:14:08.566 --> 00:14:09.796
Blade Rain!

00:14:17.333 --> 00:14:20.633
Listen, Andropov.
Keep your distance!

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.570
Who are you ordering?

00:14:25.933 --> 00:14:26.933
Schneider.

00:14:27.966 --> 00:14:29.866
Andropov is still a child.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.930
Look after him.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.270
Roger.

00:14:39.566 --> 00:14:40.566
Let's keep going!

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:41.770
Right!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.130
Luminous Ball!

00:14:53.666 --> 00:14:55.696
Eternity Reflection!

00:15:02.666 --> 00:15:04.166
Diagonal to the right!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.100
Did we do it?

00:15:10.866 --> 00:15:11.866
No, not yet.

00:15:15.333 --> 00:15:16.003
But, you know...

00:15:16.366 --> 00:15:18.126
It's easier to fight

00:15:18.166 --> 00:15:20.866
with just the two of us
without any people around.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:27.270
Here they come!

00:15:32.866 --> 00:15:34.066
It's a strong wind.

00:15:54.133 --> 00:15:56.773
Do you really think we
should've come this way?

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.270
We didn't have a choice.

00:15:58.300 --> 00:16:01.330
We had to do it to
keep moving forward.

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.770
I'm a hero, maro.

00:16:04.233 --> 00:16:05.703
They were annoying people

00:16:05.733 --> 00:16:08.503
but I don't like leaving
teammates behind, maro.

00:16:08.533 --> 00:16:11.303
Don't think about that right now.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.000
It doesn't bug you?

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.400
I promise. I will...

00:16:18.766 --> 00:16:21.596
No, we will never die.

00:16:22.233 --> 00:16:23.233
So please...

00:16:34.266 --> 00:16:34.926
Now!

00:16:35.133 --> 00:16:35.803
Right!

00:16:36.666 --> 00:16:37.926
Dark Shine!

00:16:47.366 --> 00:16:48.466
It worked!

00:16:48.833 --> 00:16:49.933
Of course!

00:16:50.633 --> 00:16:53.033
Alright, let's finish them off.

00:16:53.433 --> 00:16:54.103
Yeah!

00:17:05.533 --> 00:17:07.773
Blast Arrow!

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:20.700
Did we do it?

00:17:20.733 --> 00:17:23.073
Y-Yeah... I think so.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:24.700
Schneider!

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.700
Are you okay?

00:17:29.466 --> 00:17:30.466
Sorry.

00:17:32.466 --> 00:17:33.466
What?

00:17:33.966 --> 00:17:34.626
Nothing.

00:17:38.266 --> 00:17:41.766
I just never imagined
that of all of us,

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.430
the youngest would be
helping me like this...

00:17:46.066 --> 00:17:47.066
But...

00:17:48.766 --> 00:17:52.326
I think it's time to stop
treating you like a kid.

00:17:53.033 --> 00:17:54.033
Especially because of...

00:17:55.833 --> 00:17:56.503
That girl.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:01.070
B-Be quiet!
This isn't the time toâ€”

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.670
What's wrong, General Logi?

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.370
Nothing.

00:18:24.166 --> 00:18:25.466
Let's keep moving forward.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.870
No, wait! Let's go back!

00:18:28.666 --> 00:18:29.666
What?

00:18:30.066 --> 00:18:31.926
Something happened to them,
didn't it?

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:33.400
I don't know.

00:18:34.166 --> 00:18:38.026
But they're putting their lives on
the line to fulfill their duties.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.670
I can't just ignore their will.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:43.670
Let's go.

00:18:43.866 --> 00:18:44.526
No!

00:18:45.033 --> 00:18:49.233
I don't want to sacrifice
anyone for us.

00:18:49.866 --> 00:18:52.326
We may have been enemies once...

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:53.570
But...

00:18:54.066 --> 00:18:55.796
I will save everyone!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.030
That's my will!

00:18:58.133 --> 00:18:58.803
Wait!

00:19:00.066 --> 00:19:01.066
Kluke...

00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:02.003
Don't.

00:19:03.866 --> 00:19:06.426
He said he won't die.

00:19:06.866 --> 00:19:09.096
So I'm going to believe his words!

00:19:09.933 --> 00:19:10.933
Kluke...

00:19:11.466 --> 00:19:15.366
So we must do what we must!

00:19:24.966 --> 00:19:26.696
Sch... Schneider...

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:32.130
I-Idiot...
Don't force yourself to talk.

00:19:33.566 --> 00:19:34.726
One more shot...

00:19:35.033 --> 00:19:35.703
What?

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.870
I have one more shot...

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.430
Use...that...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.830
Please...

00:19:46.433 --> 00:19:47.433
Andropov!

00:20:06.866 --> 00:20:09.566
Andropov... General Logi...

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:18.170
Blast...Arrow!

00:20:26.466 --> 00:20:27.126
What?!

00:20:27.166 --> 00:20:28.366
An earthquake, maro!

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.070
No...

00:20:46.433 --> 00:20:53.173
General Logi... We have...
We have accomplished the mission.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.670
However...

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:56.530
It seems like...

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.070
I couldn't look after Andropov...

00:21:01.833 --> 00:21:03.573
after all.

00:21:11.233 --> 00:21:12.603
Hey, you.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.330
You're pretty good.
What's your name?

00:21:18.266 --> 00:21:19.266
Schneider.

00:21:20.933 --> 00:21:23.003
The look in your eyes...
Not too bad.

00:21:33.133 --> 00:21:35.133
Never let your guard down
no matter what!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.700
We're going to chase them!
Come with me!

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:42.300
You wanted to see me, sir?

00:21:43.233 --> 00:21:46.603
We're establishing
the Independent Flying Squadron.

00:21:46.833 --> 00:21:47.873
Are you coming with me?

00:21:53.566 --> 00:21:54.566
General Logi...

00:21:56.033 --> 00:21:57.603
I'm sorry.

00:21:58.333 --> 00:22:01.133
I just need to...rest a while.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:08.670
What happened?

00:22:09.833 --> 00:22:10.503
The wind...

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:14.500
The wind stopped blowing.

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:20.000
Schneider... Andropov...

00:22:21.866 --> 00:22:22.896
Great work!

00:22:31.233 --> 00:22:32.233
That's...

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:39.800
Zola!

00:24:18.533 --> 00:24:20.133
Zola finally appears,

00:24:20.166 --> 00:24:23.196
but her betrayal was to
save Shu and the others.

00:24:23.233 --> 00:24:26.073
That's what I thought.
I knew she wouldn't betray us.

00:24:26.100 --> 00:24:27.600
But this preview is a lie, right?

00:24:27.633 --> 00:24:28.303
Shoot!

00:24:28.333 --> 00:24:30.633
Then, she really did betray us?

00:24:30.666 --> 00:24:32.266
That's also a lie, maro.

00:24:32.300 --> 00:24:34.000
Which one is it, Zola?

00:24:34.333 --> 00:24:36.233
Next on Blue Dragon:
Zola
